## Hello!

My name is Caitlin McCann, and I am currently working on a PhD in Horticulture at North Carolina State University in [the lab of Dr. Hsuan Chen](https://cals.ncsu.edu/horticultural-science/people/hchen57/). I completed my MS in the University of Georgia's Institute of Plant Breeding, Genetics, and Genomics, and my BS in Biology at the University of Alabama - You can access my resume [here](Images_files\2026%20McCann%20Resume.pdf)

